OL,3,AWebsites taken down across Europe as
OL,4,Acritical cyber-security update issued
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Finnish government, Edinburgh
OL,7,Fcouncil and the BBC are among those to
OL,8,Fhave taken down sites and pages ahead
OL,9,Fof a software update to a programming
OL,10,Flanguage which underpins many online
OL,11,Fservices.
OL,13,FTwo critical vulnerabilities have been
OL,14,Ffound with the PHP programming
OL,15,Flanguage, which is widely used across
OL,16,Fthe internet. A fix was issued on
OL,17,FWednesday afternoon.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
